  m_text: "<b><color=#5dade2>STEALMAN \u2014 M1 TECHNICAL PROOF</color></b>\n<size=16>\u2022
    <b>[BLUE]</b> Stealable Door (Ghost on Steal)\n\u2022 <b>[BROWN]</b> Stealable
    Drawbridge (Lowers)\n\u2022 <b>[CYAN]</b> Stealable Platform (Freezes)\n\u2022
    <b><color=#f4d03f>[YELLOW]</color></b> Trap Hazard (Tap Recover)\n\u2022 <b><color=#e74c3c>[RED]</color></b>
    Danger Light (Destruction)\n\u2022 <b><color=#2ecc71>[GREEN]</color></b> Exit
    Zone (Complete)</size>"
